    "title": "City Barbeque",
    "description": "Order the city\u2019s best barbeque for curbside, delivery, or in-store pickup, plus earn points toward free BBQ with City Rewards!\r\n\r\nAbout City Rewards\r\n\r\n\u2022 Earn rewards for eating BBQ: one point for every $1 spent, every 100 points = $5 in free BBQ\r\n\u2022 Redeem rewards for more barbeque\r\n\u2022 Get special offers and surprises, plus double points every Monday\r\n\u2022 Be the first to hear about new \u2018que on the menu\r\n\u2022 Get special (sweet) treats for your birthday and anniversary\r\n\r\nAbout the App\r\n\r\n\u2022 Order for curbside, delivery, or in-store pickup, for now or for later\r\n\u2022 Find your closest City Barbeque joint\r\n\u2022 Save favorite meals for future re-orders\r\n\u2022 Save addresses and payment methods to your account, too\r\n\u2022 Check out with a credit card or gift card\r\n\u2022 Drive-Thru Recognition: Enable \"Always Allow\" location when prompted and Accept Nearby Devices and we will automatically identify you when you're approaching the drive-thru so you can automatically earn points without without the need to pull out your phone",
    "descriptionHTML": "Order the city\u2019s best barbeque for curbside, delivery, or in-store pickup, plus earn points toward free BBQ with City Rewards!<br><br>About City Rewards<br><br>\u2022 Earn rewards for eating BBQ: one point for every $1 spent, every 100 points = $5 in free BBQ<br>\u2022 Redeem rewards for more barbeque<br>\u2022 Get special offers and surprises, plus double points every Monday<br>\u2022 Be the first to hear about new \u2018que on the menu<br>\u2022 Get special (sweet) treats for your birthday and anniversary<br><br>About the App<br><br>\u2022 Order for curbside, delivery, or in-store pickup, for now or for later<br>\u2022 Find your closest City Barbeque joint<br>\u2022 Save favorite meals for future re-orders<br>\u2022 Save addresses and payment methods to your account, too<br>\u2022 Check out with a credit card or gift card<br>\u2022 Drive-Thru Recognition: Enable &quot;Always Allow&quot; location when prompted and Accept Nearby Devices and we will automatically identify you when you&#39;re approaching the drive-thru so you can automatically earn points without without the need to pull out your phone",
